Subject: [net v3 3/5] net: sgi: ioc3-eth: simplify setting the DMA mask
Date:   Mon,  4 Nov 2019 11:45:13 +0100
Message-Id: <20191104104515.7066-3-tbogendoerfer@suse.de>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.16.4
